        "inventory_expansion_required": false,
        "statement": "Take a two-vertex graph with one link $e:v_1\\to v_2$, one fermion mode per vertex and zero backgrounds. The zero-electric, zero-occupation vector $\\Omega$ is physical. The bounded creation operator $O=c^\\dagger_{v_1,1}$ has nonzero gauge charge at $v_1$, so its expectation in any physical vector, including $\\Omega$, vanishes.\n\n",
